<title>USA: Bell Industries sets 20 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Bell Industries sets 20 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bell Industries Inc said its board declared a 20 percent stock dividend for distribution on June 11, 1997 to shareholders of record on May 30, 1997.</p>
<p>Bell has 7,616,000 common shares currently outstanding.</p>
<p>The Company had previously declared five percent stock dividends in 1996, 1995 and 1994, and a four percent stock dividend in 1993.</p>
